ers is set to play in Saturday's game vs. No. 1 Georgia after not appearing on the injury report Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-19T03:01:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50526154/south-carolina-qb-lanorris-sellers-set-play-vs-georgia","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"NC State names NFL assistant Jason Michael as OC under Philip Rivers","published":"2026-11-19T12:21:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50524698/nc-state-names-nfl-assistant-michael-oc-rivers","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia AG asks SEC to take action against LSU's 'contempt for the rules'","description":"The Georgia Attorney General blasted LSU in a letter to SEC commissioner Greg Sankey, encouraging sanctions against the Tigers, \"up to and including expulsion.\"","published":"2026-11-19T04:59:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/50524054/georgia-ag-asks-sec-take-action-vs-lsu-expulsion","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach and Pete Thamel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Alabama running back prospect AK Dear no longer with team","description":"Alabama tailback AK Dear, a former four-star prospect who was poised to make an impact before suffering an injury in the summer, is no longer on the team.","published":"2026-11-18T19:16:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50523034/alabama-running-back-prospect-ak-dear-no-longer-team","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Judge questions LSU's claims the SEC 'hallucinated' citations","description":"At a hearing Wednesday in the SEC's lawsuit against LSU, a federal judge pushed back on LSU attorneys for using the word \"hallucinated\" in filing.","published":"2026-11-18T22:40:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50522883/judge-questions-lsu-claims-sec-hallucinated-citations","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-18T22:17:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5138451/luke-reynolds","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":42,"round":2,"team":"NO","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Luke Reynolds (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-17T20:10:34Z","intro":"Luke Reynolds is an American college football tight end for the Virginia Tech Hokies. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Reynolds grew up in Westford, Massachusetts and originally attended Lawrence Academy in Groton, Massachusetts. He transferred to Cheshire Academy in Cheshire, Connecticut after his sophomore year. As a senior, he caught 48 passes for 754 yards and nine touchdowns. After the season Reynolds played in the 2024 All-American Bowl.\nReynolds was initially rated a three-star recruit and committed to play college football at Penn State. He was later reranked as a five-star recruit and the best tight end prospect in the 2024 class by 247Sports."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Reynolds joined the Penn State Nittany Lions as an early enrollee in January 2024. He entered his freshman season as a backup at tight end to Tyler Warren. Reynolds finished his first season with the team with nine receptions for 111 yards and one touchdown. He played in all 13 of the Nittany Lions' games as a sophomore and caught 26 passes for 257 yards. After the end of the season, Reynolds entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nReynolds transferred to Virginia Tech, reuniting him with former Penn State head coach James Franklin."}]}}